        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion 18-Z8, Elite Collection Violet Victorian Glass Knob with Rope Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIf purple is the color of royalty than the Elite Violet Glass Knob with Traditional Rope Rose is the perfect manifestation of divine right in the world of door hardware. Everything about this knob is not only beautiful, but also sophisticated. The Violet Glass Knob with Rope Rose will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an adjustable backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. The Rope Rosette is available in 5 finishes including oil rubbed bronze, polished brass, and brushed chrome.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion 18 Z8 Victorian Violet Knob with Rope Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>Exclusive Fusion knob spring assembly for lifetime performance.</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish.</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose cover.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Victorian Glass Knob With Rope Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/8\" to 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Glass</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Elite Violet Glass Knob with Traditional Rope Rose, Fusion 18-Z8",
                "description": "Fusion 18-Z8, Elite Violet Glass Knob with Traditional Rope Rose - If purple is the color of royalty than the Elite Violet Glass Knob with Traditional Rope Rose is the perfect manifestation of divine right in the world of door hardware. Everything about this knob is not only beautiful, but also sophisticated. The Violet Glass Knob with Rope Rose will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an adjustable backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. The Rope Rosette is available in 5 finishes including oil rubbed bronze, polished brass, and brushed chrome.",
